{%- comment -%}
  horizon-blocks Phase 10 — `collection-title` block.

  Port of stock Horizon v4.1.1 (68760d9) blocks/collection-title.liquid;
  schema t: strings hardcoded to Horizon's English. Deviations (all
  text-block/product-title precedents):
  - 'placeholders.collection_title' | t hardcoded ("Collection title").
  - Custom-preset Font select trimmed 4 -> 2 options (Dawn has 2 real font
    settings; subheading/accent values in hand-written JSON still resolve
    via hz-type-variables aliases).
  - The type_preset `info` key is dropped — it links to per-preset theme
    settings that don't exist in Dawn.
  Renders the Phase-1b text snippet (fallback_text contract).
{%- endcomment -%}
{% if closest.collection == blank %}
    {% assign collection_title = '<p>Collection title</p>' %}
  {% render 'text', fallback_text: collection_title, block: block %}
{% elsif closest.collection != blank %}
  {% assign collection_title = '<p>' | append: closest.collection.title | append: '</p>' %}
  {% render 'text', fallback_text: collection_title, block: block %}
{% endif %}

